[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://b1td1tpl3path"]

; Template — three paths from left/top/bottom converging at the right base.
; Mirrors the Level1 pattern. Path "left" runs along the centerline; "top"
; descends from the upper edge; "bottom" rises from the lower edge. 8 spots —
; 4 along the centerline cluster + 2 covering the top approach + 2 covering
; the bottom approach. Use case: classic three-front Kingdom-Rush layout.

